---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sporty — Terms (Draft)" description="Draft terms of service for the Sporty MVP.">
  <main class="terms-shell">
    <h1 class="section-title">Terms of Service (Draft)</h1>
    <p class="lead-copy">Formal legal terms will be published before launch. Until then, use this draft to understand how Sporty expects the product to be used.</p>

    <section class="terms-card">
      <h2>Usage</h2>
      <p>Sporty provides sport recommendations for personal discovery. Do not rely on Sporty for medical advice or high-risk decisions.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
      <h2>Data</h2>
      <p>Measurements are processed transiently unless you opt in. Account holders can delete saved measurements/results, revoke storage consent, or permanently delete their account in <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard → Account &amp; Data</a>. Sporty may retain a minimal pseudonymous billing ledger where required by law.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms-card">
      <h2>Credits</h2>
      <p>Premium credits support deeper analyses. Credits are non-transferable and tied to the purchasing account.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2" defer></script>
    <script is:inline src="/config.js" defer></script>
    <script is:inline src="/assets/js/app.js?v=8" defer></script>
  </Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
